cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the benchmarks you report results on."
type: software
title: "BrahmAI Eval"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible evaluation suite for language models: one command runs a Hugging Face checkpoint on
  open English, code, mathematics, Indic-language and tool-use benchmarks with vLLM and the
  lm-evaluation-harness, from pinned public data, and writes results with full provenance.
  Developed as part of the BrahmAI project, supported by the IndiaAI Mission. ZenteiQ acknowledges the support of the IndiaAI Mission, Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology (MeitY), under the Foundation Model initiative.
authors:
  - name: "ZenteiQ AiTech Innovations Pvt. Ltd."
    email: research@zenteiq.ai
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/zenteiq-research/brahmai-eval"
keywords:
  - evaluation
  - benchmark
  - language models
  - Indic languages
  - tool use
  - reproducibility
